WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:04.726
Unit sixteen. Online Cartoons Safety!

2
00:00:05.643 --> 00:00:10.250
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.061
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.111 --> 00:00:18.455
Today we learn about Online Cartoons Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.704
Cartoon. Say it with me. Cartoon!

6
00:00:27.174 --> 00:00:32.038
Safe content. Say it with me. Safe content!

7
00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:39.909
Kid-friendly. Say it with me. Kid-friendly!

8
00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:47.899
Supervision. Say it with me. Supervision!

9
00:00:51.399 --> 00:00:55.555
Appropriate. Say it with me. Appropriate!

10
00:00:59.047 --> 00:01:02.902
Watch. Say it with me. Watch!

11
00:01:06.412 --> 00:01:10.946
Adult check. Say it with me. Adult check!

12
00:01:14.401 --> 00:01:18.717
Screen time. Say it with me. Screen time!

13
00:01:22.264 --> 00:01:30.830
Watching an online cartoon safely means choosing kid-friendly, appropriate content with adult supervision and checking screen time.

14
00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.514
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:35.531 --> 00:01:41.001
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.051 --> 00:01:42.414
Kid-friendly!

17
00:01:43.425 --> 00:01:48.960
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:50.424
Adult check!

19
00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:59.947
Did you know? Many streaming services have a special 'kids' section with cartoons chosen to be safe and appropriate!

20
00:01:59.997 --> 00:02:02.468
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:03.561 --> 00:02:13.966
Think and answer. Why is it helpful to have an adult check what cartoons you watch online?

22
00:02:14.016 --> 00:02:15.188
Great answer!

23
00:02:16.182 --> 00:02:21.681
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:21.731 --> 00:02:24.734
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

